qrrx-2qgv","cve_id":"CVE-2026-123501","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-qgpv-qrrx-2qgv","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qgpv-qrrx-2qgv","summary":"Vikunja before 2.7.1 contains an uncontrolled resource consumption vulnerability that allows...","description":"Vikunja before 2.7.1 contains an uncontrolled resource consumption vulnerability that allows authenticated users to exhaust server memory through concurrent image decodes in avatar and background uploads. Attackers can send several parallel tiny, highly compressible PNGs decoded at up to 50 megapixels each, pushing the API process into memory pressure or an OOM kill.","type":"unreviewed","severity":"high","repository_advisory_url":null,"source_code_location":"","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-qgpv-qrrx-2qgv","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-123501","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://github.com/go-vikunja/vikunja/security/advisories/GHSA-9hxw-pxcq-4q8q","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-123501","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/vikunja-before-2.7.1-memory-exhaustion-dos-via-unbounded-image-decodes","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-qgpv-qrrx-2qgv"],"published_at":"2026-11-08T03:30:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T03:30:34Z","github_reviewed_at":null,"nvd_published_at":"2026-11-08T02:16:37Z","withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H","score":6.5},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","score":7.1}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-400","name":"Uncontrolled Resource Consumption"}],"credits":[],"comments":0,"cvss":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H","score":6.5}},{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-pvgh-54fw-mm3m","cve_id":"CVE-2026-123495","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-pvgh-54fw-mm3m","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-pvgh-54fw-mm3m","summary":"Vikunja 2.0.0 before 2.7.1 accepts form-encoded bodies on the /api/v2 login and OIDC callback...","description":"Vikunja 2.0.0 before 2.7.1 accepts form-encoded bodies on the /api/v2 login and OIDC callback endpoints without CSRF or Origin checks, enabling login cross-site request forgery. An attacker with an account can lure a victim to a page posting the attacker's credentials or OIDC code, switching the victim into the attacker's account and exposing data the victim then adds.","type":"unreviewed","severity":"medium","repository_advisory_url":null,"source_code_location":"","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-pvgh-54fw-mm3m","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-123495","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://github.com/go-vikunja/vikunja/security/advisories/GHSA-frf4-3prf-3vch","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-123495","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/vikunja-2.0.0-before-2.7.1-login-csrf-via-api-v2-login-and-oidc-callback","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-pvgh-54fw-mm3m"],"published_at":"2026-11-08T03:30:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T03:30:34Z","github_reviewed_at":null,"nvd_published_at":"2026-11-08T02:16:36Z","withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N","score":4.6},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","score":5.1}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-352","name":"Cross-Site Request Forgery"}],"credits":[],"comments":0,"cvss":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:N","score":4.6}},{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-526f-fc44-8pmq","cve_id":"CVE-2026-123502","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-526f-fc44-8pmq","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-526f-fc44-8pmq","summary":"Vikunja before 2.7.1 contains an information exposure vulnerability that a